# ============================================================
# SmartPort — .gitignore
# Nguyen tac: cai gi TU SINH LAI DUOC, TRUNG LAP, hoac CHUA BI MAT thi khong len git.
# ============================================================

# ---------- Rac build (.NET / Visual Studio) — tu sinh lai khi build ----------
bin/
obj/
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.cache
*.pdb
TestResults/

# ---------- BI MAT — tuyet doi khong day ----------
# Mat khau tai khoan ung dung (chi luu tren may ban)
TAI-KHOAN-MOI.txt
# Ban sao luu appsettings goc co mat khau somee that
*.bak
*.local-backup
# Moi file cau hinh "local"/"secret" neu sau nay co
appsettings.*.local.json
*.secret.json
.env
.env.*

# ---------- Ban sao trung lap / luu tru ----------
# Bo dong goi di thi = ban sao y nguyen cua SmartPort.Net10 + tai lieu (508 MB)
NopThi_*/
# Ban MVC5 da ngung phat trien (216 MB) va Web.config cua no co mat khau
_Cu_KhongDung/
# Thu muc tam gom file cho Claude Design (ban sao CSS + anh)
_ThietKe_ChoClaudeDesign/

# ---------- File tam / he dieu hanh ----------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
~$*
*.tmp

# ---------- Model AI: CO day (app can chung de chay offline) ----------
# Khong ignore *.onnx / *.wasm / tessdata — chung la mot phan cua san pham.
